o their face.","style":{"color":"#A9A9A9"}},{"text":" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I'm...I'm sorry! It was all just my personal conjecture, of course... Anyone would be doubtful if they haven't seen it happen, right? Haha..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"MP41","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"98k","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Kar98k","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It's alright, I don't really care what others think of me."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"MP41","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"98k","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"MP41","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Heheh, everyone says that, but who knows? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Actually, I have this secret mission. If you come with me, I can testify to your achievements in battle!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"MP41","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"98k","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Kar98k","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I believe the Commander has already ordered all Dolls to withdraw from this base. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Aren't you going to prepare for departure?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"MP41","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"98k","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"MP41","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The secret mission has everything to do with the order to withdraw. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Actually, I have done some investigation and I know how Sangvis Ferri is planning to attack!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"MP41","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"MP41","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I won't just tell anyone about this. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But since you're an elite T-Doll, I'll reluctantly let you in on my plan!"}